  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">R&#xE9;ponse rapide d&#x2019;urgence aux cons&#xE9;quences sanitaires de la crise humanitaire complexe dans les Provinces de l&#x2019;Est de la R&#xE9;publique D&#xE9;mocratique du Congo (Nord-Kivu et Ituri).</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide health assistance to vulnerable people affected by conflict and displacement in the eastern Democratic Republic of the Congo. This WHO project strengthens the surveillance of and response to disease outbreaks, provides access to health care services, including mental health and psychosocial support, and supports victims of gender-based violence, among other activities. The project provides life-saving assistance in the Health sector to 212,000 people, including 65,700 women, 85,000 children, and 31,800 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
